@startuml
title MDR-D04 Data Source and Projection Model
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Central PMS\nsource records/events" as Central
component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider evidence events/readbacks" as Payment
component "POS Server fiscal evidence\nrecorded through Central PMS" as PosEvidence
component "Gate Integration\nevents" as Gate
component "Operator Console\nworkflow/audit events" as Operator
component "Continuity events" as Continuity
component "Reconciliation events" as Reconciliation
component "Audit / Event / Outbox" as Audit
database "Dashboard Projection\n/ Read Model" as Projection
component "Dashboard UI" as UI
component "Report Export" as Export

Payment --> Central : verified provider evidence
PosEvidence --> Central : fiscal document evidence\nrecorded by Central PMS
Gate --> Central : gate/exit outcome records
Operator --> Audit
Continuity --> Audit
Reconciliation --> Audit
Central --> Audit
Audit --> Projection : project metrics,\nsource labels,\nfreshness timestamps
Projection --> UI : dashboards with\nstaleness labels
Projection --> Export : authorized exports\nwith source labels

note right of Projection
Projection records must label:
- source of truth
- last refresh time
- freshness/staleness state
- operational vs canonical financial/fiscal basis
end note

note bottom
Projection data must not overwrite canonical payment, fiscal, exit,
vendor, reconciliation, or audit records.
end note
@enduml
